		],
		"excerpt": "B\"H Boruch Hashem Blessed is He Ohr HaGnuz — How to Play The Awtsmoos renews the road, the traveler, and every hidden spark in sight; Awtsmoos.com makes the first step simple, then lets the deeper world reveal its light. The 20 second version You are in an overhead adventure world. Keep your eyes on the active Shlichus",
		"searchText": "b\"h boruch hashem blessed is he ohr hagnuz — how to play the awtsmoos renews the road, the traveler, and every hidden spark in sight; awtsmoos.com makes the first step simple, then lets the deeper world reveal its light. the 20 second version you are in an overhead adventure world. keep your eyes on the active shlichus at the upper left, move through the map, approach the people or objects named by the objective, and interact when you are close enough. desktop controls move: wasd or the arrow keys. interact / continue dialogue: e or enter. legacy interact keys: z and space still work. back / close: x or escape where a dialogue or panel supports it. walk to a place: click the ground and the hero will path toward that tile. touch controls use the on screen direction controls for precise movement. you can also tap reachable ground to walk there automatically. use the visible action/interact control when you are beside a person or meaningful object. the basic game loop 1. read the active shlichus objective. 2. move through the top down world toward the relevant place, person, or object. 3. press e / enter when you are close enough to interact. 4. follow the dialogue, encounter, or objective update. 5. continue until the shlichus advances. deeper systems the lower navigation dock opens the journal, world map, party, inventory, skills/crafting, passages, and more. these systems are still available, but ordinary play keeps the world and current objective visually primary. one useful rule if you are unsure what to do, return to the active shlichus, move toward what it names, and interact nearby. the game is designed so movement and purpose come before dashboard management.",
		"page": "pages/geelooy-games-ohr-hagnuz-how-to-play-md-cb7beec9cc.json"
	},
