		],
		"excerpt": "B\"H Ohr HaGnuz Expansion Brainstorm The goal is not to copy Pokemon or RuneScape; the goal is to make a single player Torah soul RPG with the research, exploration, collection, combat, skilling, and quest depth that makes those games feel infinite. 1. World Multi region open world: village, beist midrash, forest, orcha",
		"searchText": "b\"h ohr hagnuz expansion brainstorm the goal is not to copy pokemon or runescape; the goal is to make a single player torah soul rpg with the research, exploration, collection, combat, skilling, and quest depth that makes those games feel infinite. 1. world multi region open world: village, beist midrash, forest, orchard, river, cave, desert, midbar, shok, migdal, palace, sky gates, hidden sefiros chambers. travel gates: doors, region edges, portals, skill locked gates, quest locked gardens. random events: wild musagim, lost scrolls, singing trees, wandering magiggidim. 2. collection wild musagim as concept creatures that can be studied, sweetened, indexed, and used to unlock quests (not captured, but revealed). musag dex with question label, place found, development stage, sweetening date. iron/bronze/silver/gold mastery for each musag. 3. battle pokemon style battle screen: two visible sides, bars, exp, menu, status, animations. runescape style skill contribution: chochmah damage, binah defense, daat critical, niggun heal, hitbonenus evade. tempo system: attack, defend, meditate, niggun, source, svara. status: dazed, awe, shattered, fervor, joy, silence, ohr chozer, hitaapachut. enemy ai: logical opponents choose moves based on player status. 4. skills skills like runescape: learning, writing, niggun, hitbonenus, chesed, gevurah, tiferet, netzach, hod, yesod, malchus. each skill has level, exp, nextexp, and perks. world actions grant skill exp: read scroll, collect spark, fixbridge, meditate at tree, sing at river. 5. items inventory: sparks, scrolls, keys, chests, lamps, tools, forged letters, food, niggun shards. garments: equipment that changes appearance, stats, moves, and battle effects. tools: pen, lamp, kleiznemer, forge hammer, bridge nusach. 6. quests main quest: gather hidden light through seven regions. region quests: village, beist midrash, forest, river, cave, orchard, forge, ruins. side quests: npc memories, skill tutorials, rare musagim, reward garments. quest chains with prerequisites and stages. 7. nncs every npc has unique glyph, story, quest, battle or skill function. npc story progresses as quests complete. some npcs are shops, trainers, teleporters, skill masters, secret path guides. 8. ui/\u0015t kh\u0013z[�[x\\ ���\u0005\u0017vw7b\u0006��r��\u00056����\u0007\u0006\u0016�v���\u0004��fv�f�'�\u0007\u0006\u0016�v���\u0004�w6\u0016r\u0006fw���\u0004&\u0017gf�r\u000767&vv�\u0007v�f�\u0006��fw2�\u00077f\u0017gw2�\u0006&\u0017'2�\u0006\u0016��\u0017f���2��\u0005\u0007&w6wb\u0007fw7b\u0006�v�s�\u0007fw7b\u0006f��'2�\u0006f�&w7b�\u0006w&\u001772�\u0007g&\u0016��w\"�\u0006֖fv\u0016�r�\u0006&�72ࠣ��\u0004\u0017wf��\u0017f���\u0006\u0016�b\u0005fw7f��p��\u0004\u0017wf��v\u0016ʋ\u0006'�\u00066ɩ6���\u0005\u0007&w6wb\u0007\u0006\u0017f�2\u0006f�\"\u0006f��'2�\u0006vfvw2�\u0006w&\u001772�\u0004�\u000472�\u0006�fv�2��\u00056���r\u0007fw7g2\u0006f�\"\u0006&\u0017gf�w2�\u0007\u0006�'f\u0016�2�\u0007\u0017vw7g2�\u00076����2�\u0006�\u0017\u0002\u0006��\u0016f��r��\u0004&�b\u0007\u0006�\u0017�fw7b\u0006g&��\u0007f���\u0016vr\u0007f�\u0006֖fv\u0016�rࠣ\u0013\u0002\u00056\u0017fr���\u0016@��\u0004��6\u0016�7f�&\u0016vr\u00076\u0017fr��\u0004\u0017wf�6\u0017fr\u0006\u0016gfw\"\u0007\u0017vw7b\u00066��\u0006�wf����\u0006v\u0017&�v�b\u0007v���6��\u0006�wfv�\u0007w\u0002��\u0004w�\u0006�'b���\u0006�'b\u00076\u0017fr\u00066�frࠤ��\u0006�v�v�f\u0017f���\u0006�&fw ��\u0012�\u00056����2\u0006f�v�f\u0017f����\"�\u00056����\u0004u�\u0002\u0007v�&vb\u0006��f�\u0006&\u0017gf�w2\u0006\u0016�b\u0006�fv�2�2�\u0004�w6\u0016r\u0006fw�\u0006f�v�f\u0017f����b�\u0005t�\u0006�fw&�\u0017�\u0006f�\"\u00076����2�\u0007\u0017vw7g2�\u0006��fv�f�'��r�\u0004v�vג\u0004\u0014�\u0006\u0016�b\u00077f\u0017gw2\u0006��fw2�b�\u0004��&r\u0006�\u0017\u00072\u0006\u0016�b\u0007\u0017vw7b\u00066�\u0016��2�r�\u00056\u0017fr���\u0016bࣂ�\u0004&�b\u0007\u0006�\u0017�fw7b�",
